Data files published in this repository's Releases (Ukraine and Israel) are derived
from OpenStreetMap data:

  - road network files: ua-roads.bin, kyiv-roads.bin, il-roads.bin (*-roads.bin)
  - road extras (speed limits, cameras, level crossings, traffic calming):
    *-extras.bin and *-extras2.bin (format 2)
  - building outlines: *-buildings.bin (with manifests buildings-*.json)
  - map tiles: map-*.pmtiles (Protomaps Basemap — a Produced Work under the ODbL)
  - routing tiles (Valhalla): routes-*.tar; road graph for routing: roads-*.sqlite
  - search data: search-*.sqlite
  - manifests describing these files: manifest.json

Not derived from OpenStreetMap: map-assets.tar (Noto Sans fonts, SIL OFL 1.1, and map
icons from protomaps/basemaps-assets) — under their own licenses.

